WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.006
The bunnies brought Silvertail to the tree.

2
00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:11.647
Silvertail looked in the hole.

3
00:00:11.648 --> 00:00:15.382
"I don't see any nuts."

4
00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:17.480
Silvertail bent deeper.

5
00:00:17.481 --> 00:00:20.014
"Where are—Yikes!"

6
00:00:20.015 --> 00:00:22.353
Silvertail fell into the hole.

7
00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:29.895
"Ahh!" he cried. "I'm stuck!"

8
00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:34.339
The bunnies laughed.

9
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.981
"The nut thief is trapped!" Peter said.

10
00:00:37.982 --> 00:00:48.249
"Good-bye, Silvertail!" Benjamin said.

11
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.601
The bunnies told the squirrels about Silvertail.

12
00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:54.750
The squirrels stopped fighting.

13
00:00:54.751 --> 00:00:58.156
"I have a great idea," Timmy said.

14
00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:07.245
"Let's share our nuts!"

15
00:01:07.246 --> 00:01:10.713
The squirrels shared all the nuts.

16
00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:14.829
Timmy gave some to the bunnies.

17
00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:18.456
"Thank you for helping us," Timmy said.

18
00:01:18.457 --> 00:01:27.529
"We can save these nuts for our feast!" Peter said.

19
00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:31.632
At last it was time for the harvest feast.

20
00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:38.554
All the squirrels came.

21
00:01:38.555 --> 00:01:41.293
Timmy rubbed his belly.

22
00:01:41.294 --> 00:01:45.596
"These nut pies are delicious!"

23
00:01:45.597 --> 00:01:47.814
Then someone else appeared.

24
00:01:47.815 --> 00:01:51.398
Peter gasped. "Silvertail!"

25
00:01:51.399 --> 00:01:55.348
Benjamin laughed.

26
00:01:55.349 --> 00:01:59.162
"He's not fat anymore!"

27
00:01:59.163 --> 00:02:01.785
Silvertail frowned at the bunnies.

28
00:02:01.786 --> 00:02:04.436
"You trapped me in the tree!

29
00:02:04.437 --> 00:02:07.961
And where are all my nuts?"

30
00:02:07.962 --> 00:02:10.407
Peter pointed to the nut pies.

31
00:02:10.408 --> 00:02:12.013
"Right there."

32
00:02:12.014 --> 00:02:22.951
Everyone—but Silvertail—laughed.

